  "body": "## Changelog\n* 10c9d5335a588f611964931259163c705e528200 Make app cleanup idempotent on deletion. (#5179)\n* ce364602a26945568fbba2aefa9d3089df42f72e Carve out preflight tests into dedicated group. (#5178)\n* 1f9a546bb3bfcb2741535ca3e3c805583f3ee0fd Run Buildpack preflight test using local Docker. (#5172)\n* c6df5bbb59b24e069741071dc9013725179a9eac Report the app name with command stats (#5136)\n* 4cd511a4b63e87a845d03cc8e3af9fa468d35e87 Limit `flyctl` command timeout in preflight tests. (#5176)\n* ece94ae7ce0940b660139227427c1f14b89f86de Re-enable Postgres-flex test. (#5175)\n* a67e261b76201c0bbdb8d1fa7643c7336346fb96 Handle eventual consistency in volume tests. (#5174)\n\n"
